  "_doc": "Real iceberg.default tables shown to the model under legacy-style names (iceberg.erp.*). Keys are deliberately unhelpful: a foreign key never repeats the name of the key it points at. Each obfuscated column name maps to exactly one real column name, so SQL can be translated back by name.",
